WEBVTT

00:00:10.660 --> 00:00:13.780
It's truly an honor to be able to talk to
the second coming of the hero herself,

00:00:13.780 --> 00:00:15.120
Miss Shia.

00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:19.040
Please, I'm not worthy of such a title.

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:22.330
I've heard all about your great exploits.

00:00:22.330 --> 00:00:25.500
Is it true that you acquired
the Philosopher's Stone

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:28.260
on the fifth floor of the
Dungeon of Faria, to the west?

00:00:28.260 --> 00:00:32.510
And that you only caused 185 injuries?

00:00:32.510 --> 00:00:36.560
I couldn't have done it alone.

00:00:36.560 --> 00:00:41.480
Everyone worked so hard for the company!

00:00:41.480 --> 00:00:46.150
A group of promising rookies are returning
from our corporate training retreat.

00:00:46.150 --> 00:00:51.660
Please put your great skills to use
by their side in Detmolt.

00:00:53.490 --> 00:00:55.530
You can count on me!

00:00:55.530 --> 00:01:00.500
Work till you drop, then keep on working!
That's my motto!

00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:03.880
I'll make sure everyone is
always cranked up to 110%!

00:01:06.340 --> 00:01:08.260
Remember, fools!

00:01:08.260 --> 00:01:11.260
You are no longer human! You're swine!

00:01:11.260 --> 00:01:12.890
Thank you, sir!

00:01:12.890 --> 00:01:15.050
Can livestock do work?!

00:01:15.050 --> 00:01:16.600
Thank you, sir!

00:01:16.600 --> 00:01:22.100
Of course not! It's like you're
all scum, not even livestock!

00:01:22.100 --> 00:01:23.770
Thank you, sir!

00:01:26.400 --> 00:01:30.570
This piece of scum seems
to have an attitude problem.

00:01:30.570 --> 00:01:33.070
Thank you, sir...

00:01:33.070 --> 00:01:39.160
I live to train scum like you
into my favorite kind of swine.

00:01:39.160 --> 00:01:43.460
Here on Pig Pen Isle,
you'll inevitably end up that way.

00:01:43.460 --> 00:01:49.090
Thank you, sir. I will work.

00:01:45.250 --> 00:01:49.090
First, we'll see what
you can do in the dungeon!

00:01:49.090 --> 00:01:52.420
Hurry up and change
into dungeon exploration gear!

00:01:52.420 --> 00:01:53.880
You have three minutes to prepare!

00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:56.600
Ten squats for each second you're late!

00:01:56.600 --> 00:01:57.930
Hurry up!

00:02:02.180 --> 00:02:06.730
The Dungeon of Black Company

00:02:06.730 --> 00:02:10.480
The Dungeon of Black Company

00:03:27.970 --> 00:03:30.940
Crimson Sphincter

00:03:31.020 --> 00:03:32.980
Help!

00:03:35.990 --> 00:03:41.200
The only thing you scum can do is
charge in head first! Now go fight!

00:03:36.070 --> 00:03:40.570
Episode 3: Fun at the Corporate Training Trip

00:03:41.200 --> 00:03:43.200
That's absurd!

00:03:43.200 --> 00:03:45.330
The perfect plan that I hatched...

00:03:45.330 --> 00:03:48.670
It's all been rendered useless!

00:03:48.670 --> 00:03:50.880
Make the ants collect demonite...

00:03:50.880 --> 00:03:54.920
Get transferred to Exploration Division
Group 3, that has a lot of freedom...

00:03:54.920 --> 00:03:56.970
Manipulate the market
using the collected demonite,

00:03:56.970 --> 00:03:59.550
to control the company from
both the front and behind the scenes...

00:03:59.550 --> 00:04:03.640
to become a winner NEET across worlds...!

00:04:03.640 --> 00:04:07.060
But no...

00:04:07.060 --> 00:04:09.560
This can't be right!

00:04:09.560 --> 00:04:11.860
This is no way to die!

00:04:15.570 --> 00:04:18.030
No! Ninomiya!

00:04:18.030 --> 00:04:20.410
Ugh, that's enough.

00:04:27.580 --> 00:04:33.090
Well, well. Looks like it was too early
for you to crawl around in a dungeon.

00:04:33.090 --> 00:04:37.970
On the last day, make me feel
that this magic trap was worth using.

00:04:37.970 --> 00:04:43.640
Otherwise, the next time this explodes,
it will be under your feet.

00:04:44.470 --> 00:04:46.850
Through yesterday's session...

00:04:48.180 --> 00:04:52.600
It became obvious
that you all lack basic stamina!

00:04:52.600 --> 00:04:57.110
I'll spend the whole day training
you thoroughly! Brace yourselves!

00:04:57.110 --> 00:05:01.700
First you build stamina!
Run to the top of that mountain!

00:05:01.700 --> 00:05:07.040
Um... We haven't been given
anything to eat since yesterday.

00:05:07.040 --> 00:05:12.830
The whole purpose of this trip is
to teach you to work and make money.

00:05:12.830 --> 00:05:17.050
You haven't produced any results yet.
You don't deserve anything to eat.

00:05:17.050 --> 00:05:19.970
That's how a performance-based
evaluation system works.

00:05:19.970 --> 00:05:23.720
There. If you really want to eat,
you can pick up and eat that.

00:05:31.560 --> 00:05:33.600
So hungry...

00:05:39.820 --> 00:05:41.200
No, Ninomiya!

00:05:41.200 --> 00:05:45.030
That's Confusion Grass,
it messes up your mind if you eat it!

00:05:46.030 --> 00:05:49.290
Dammit... That's annoying.

00:05:49.290 --> 00:05:52.160
By the way, you seem
to know a lot about wild plants.

00:05:52.160 --> 00:05:55.420
I grew up in the countryside, so...

00:05:55.420 --> 00:05:58.380
Come on, Ninomiya! Let's climb!

00:05:58.380 --> 00:06:00.420
R-Right...

00:06:11.770 --> 00:06:16.360
Seems like you all need to develop
a backbone before training stamina...

00:06:16.360 --> 00:06:19.650
I'll beat that rotten core
back into shape!

00:06:21.650 --> 00:06:24.610
Next on the schedule is mental training!

00:06:24.610 --> 00:06:27.320
Maintain that posture
until I tell you to stop!

00:06:27.320 --> 00:06:30.240
Is this really skills training...?

00:06:31.910 --> 00:06:33.830
Release your mind!

00:06:48.930 --> 00:06:51.470
Spineless scum.

00:06:51.470 --> 00:06:56.520
This book contains the inspiring words
of the founder of Raiza'ha.

00:06:56.520 --> 00:06:58.650
From now on, read this
10 times a day before sleep.

00:06:58.650 --> 00:07:01.690
Engrave in your heart the
true example of how one should live!

00:07:02.440 --> 00:07:04.150
What is this training?!

00:07:04.150 --> 00:07:06.110
We can't stay here any longer!

00:07:06.110 --> 00:07:08.240
Come on, calm down.

00:07:08.240 --> 00:07:10.580
I'm going to quit this terrible place!

00:07:10.580 --> 00:07:13.750
You shouldn't say such a thing.

00:07:13.750 --> 00:07:16.080
Nobody made you choose this path.

00:07:16.080 --> 00:07:20.250
Even if it's tough,
you have to be proactive about it.

00:07:20.250 --> 00:07:23.300
What a model corporate grunt attitude...

00:07:25.170 --> 00:07:30.800
I'm starting to change after I got here.
In a good way, of course.

00:07:30.800 --> 00:07:34.270
What's wrong with this guy?
Was he always like this?

00:07:34.270 --> 00:07:38.900
Actually... It's not just him.
This all feels unnatural.

00:07:38.900 --> 00:07:43.940
All of the guys who are resisting
this training are elf-types.

00:07:43.940 --> 00:07:47.450
The beastman-types are starting
to interpret the training favorably,

00:07:47.450 --> 00:07:49.700
like Wanibe is...

00:07:49.700 --> 00:07:52.030
Is it a coincidence? No...

00:07:52.030 --> 00:07:56.540
What's most unnatural is
the fact that even I, of all people,

00:07:56.540 --> 00:07:58.460
am starting to feel that it's not so bad.

00:08:03.630 --> 00:08:06.840
This thing must be starting
to show its effects by now.

00:08:06.840 --> 00:08:09.720
The proprietary Raiza'ha brainwash disc...

00:08:09.720 --> 00:08:13.760
Thank you, sir.
Thank you, sir. Until I die.

00:08:10.340 --> 00:08:15.220
Even the elves who have magical
resistances are starting to succumb.

00:08:13.760 --> 00:08:18.140
Thank you, sir.
Thank you, sir. I will work.

00:08:15.220 --> 00:08:18.140
Yes, this is group brainwashing...

00:08:18.140 --> 00:08:23.650
There's nothing more fun than
watching personalities melt over time!

00:08:31.410 --> 00:08:33.870
Getting bored of the food here.

00:08:34.700 --> 00:08:37.200
You dig too slow! You sicken me!

00:08:37.200 --> 00:08:39.670
I could bury you in this hole
if that's what you want!

00:08:39.670 --> 00:08:40.540
W-Water...

00:08:40.540 --> 00:08:43.540
If you want water,
then fill that hole you dug!

00:08:43.540 --> 00:08:45.340
Dig and fill, dig and fill!

00:08:45.340 --> 00:08:48.880
Learn what it means to be patient,
and be ready for infinite work!

00:08:48.880 --> 00:08:51.430
Only then will you be able to drink!

00:08:53.300 --> 00:08:58.060
Oh, Ninomiya, isn't it great
to sweat under the sun?!

00:08:58.060 --> 00:09:00.060
Refreshing for both mind and body!

00:09:00.060 --> 00:09:02.600
I feel like I'm becoming a new me!

00:09:02.600 --> 00:09:03.810
Yeah...

00:09:03.810 --> 00:09:06.280
Today is outdoor orienteering training!

00:09:06.280 --> 00:09:07.690
Work together as a group!

00:09:07.690 --> 00:09:10.700
Develop collaboration skills
and a sense of responsibility!

00:09:10.700 --> 00:09:13.700
While marching, continue
to chant the corporate slogan!

00:09:18.200 --> 00:09:20.160
Are you all right?

00:09:20.160 --> 00:09:24.420
Be careful. We're all in this together.

00:09:24.420 --> 00:09:27.590
If you get hurt, it'll make us sad, too.

00:09:27.590 --> 00:09:29.970
Let's go! Let's work together!

00:09:29.970 --> 00:09:31.430
Thank you. Thank you...

00:09:31.430 --> 00:09:35.010
The Black Mage Division's
powerful brainwashing spell...

00:09:35.010 --> 00:09:37.850
Nobody can resist this.

00:09:37.850 --> 00:09:43.150
I, Kinji Ninomiya, hereby vow to work,
through selfless devotion,

00:09:43.150 --> 00:09:46.900
for the company,
and for society as a whole!

00:09:46.900 --> 00:09:49.820
That was a good speech, for scum.

00:09:49.820 --> 00:09:51.950
R-Really, sir?

00:09:51.950 --> 00:09:57.120
Wonderful... It's wonderful, Ninomiya!
You got a compliment!

00:09:57.120 --> 00:10:00.950
I've never heard such a
tremendous speech before in my life!

00:10:00.950 --> 00:10:05.670
As a coworker, I can't be more moved!
I'm so proud of you, Ninomiya!

00:10:05.670 --> 00:10:08.210
We should follow Ninomiya's example!

00:10:08.210 --> 00:10:11.420
Yes! We are the ones that will
carry this company on our backs!

00:10:11.420 --> 00:10:16.010
Come on, guys! Let's all hold what
we learned in this training to heart,

00:10:16.010 --> 00:10:18.680
and work as one to
provide value to our company!

00:10:18.680 --> 00:10:21.600
Yeah!

00:10:23.770 --> 00:10:25.150
Lady Belza...

00:10:25.150 --> 00:10:32.650
Good work everyone. I can feel
the purity of your souls from here.

00:10:32.650 --> 00:10:37.370
With such a great mindset,
I'm sure the infinite work will be easy.

00:10:37.370 --> 00:10:40.240
Oh! I now have such power!

00:10:40.240 --> 00:10:44.000
I'll work! I'll work infinitely!

00:10:44.000 --> 00:10:46.460
My life for Raiza'ha!

00:10:48.460 --> 00:10:53.510
The spiritual power of Lady Belza's words
are amplified by the Black Mages...

00:10:53.510 --> 00:10:57.300
Now the corporate grunt-pigs
are truly ready to ship!

00:10:57.420 --> 00:11:00.130
Instructor!

00:10:57.430 --> 00:11:00.130
The Dream Paradise

00:11:00.140 --> 00:11:01.680
Thank you for guiding us, sir!

00:11:01.680 --> 00:11:04.100
Now that you've overcome the training,

00:11:04.100 --> 00:11:08.060
you have the special right
to buy these Lady Belza figurines.

00:11:08.060 --> 00:11:10.940
They're 100 thousand gold each.
Do you want one?

00:11:10.940 --> 00:11:12.740
Yes, please, sir!

00:11:12.740 --> 00:11:15.240
It's not limited to one per person.

00:11:15.240 --> 00:11:16.160
I'll have two!

00:11:16.160 --> 00:11:20.160
--I'll buy three, no, eight!
--Me too! Me too! I'll buy it!

00:11:20.160 --> 00:11:21.830
Me too!

00:11:41.180 --> 00:11:45.560
Look, I bought three!
How many did you buy, Ninomiya?

00:11:45.890 --> 00:11:48.190
What is this piece of trash!

00:11:48.190 --> 00:11:51.980
What are you doing?! That's a holy idol!

00:11:51.980 --> 00:11:54.780
I was going to build
an altar at home and everything!

00:11:57.650 --> 00:12:00.280
Huh? Ninomiya?

00:12:00.280 --> 00:12:02.370
Snap out of it, Wanibe.

00:12:02.370 --> 00:12:08.250
What have I been doing?
My memory is hazy...

00:12:08.250 --> 00:12:12.130
So does that mean... It worked?!

00:12:12.130 --> 00:12:17.550
Yeah, operation "Beat Poison
With Poison"... is a success.

00:12:17.550 --> 00:12:21.220
The brainwashing attempt
couldn't have been more obvious.

00:12:21.220 --> 00:12:25.600
I'd bet they were doing something
underhanded to control us, but...

00:12:25.600 --> 00:12:29.480
We decided to mess with
our brains before they got a chance to.

00:12:29.480 --> 00:12:33.360
Your knowledge of
wild plants really helped.

00:12:33.360 --> 00:12:36.360
By taking in small
amounts of confusion grass...

00:12:36.360 --> 00:12:41.780
It was a gamble, whether or not a
messed up brain could be brainwashed.

00:12:41.780 --> 00:12:44.830
Looks like my plan worked.

00:12:44.830 --> 00:12:50.620
It would have been really bad if we
were both confused and brainwashed.

00:12:50.620 --> 00:12:55.420
Now that our heads are straight, looking
at them... I feel sorry for them...

00:12:55.420 --> 00:12:59.050
They've been turned
into tools for the company...

00:12:59.050 --> 00:13:02.300
I live my life the way
I think is most correct for me,

00:13:02.300 --> 00:13:05.310
but that "correct answer"
only applies to me.

00:13:05.310 --> 00:13:10.480
It's up to them what they do
with this experience they had.

00:13:10.480 --> 00:13:12.980
Hmm... Is it?

00:13:12.980 --> 00:13:15.820
Again, that's for you to determine.

00:13:15.820 --> 00:13:20.530
That said...
revenge is never off the table.

00:13:23.950 --> 00:13:29.830
S-Sir! Someone put confusion
grass in the mages' food!

00:13:29.830 --> 00:13:33.580
The mages have lost their minds
and are headed this way!

00:13:44.260 --> 00:13:49.640
So this is the Group 3 office
that we'll be working in...

00:13:50.310 --> 00:13:51.190
Hey!

00:13:51.190 --> 00:13:54.230
What?! What are you doing here?

00:13:54.230 --> 00:13:56.770
Oh, yeah, this guy was in Group 3, too.

00:13:56.770 --> 00:13:57.900
Let's go.

00:14:00.320 --> 00:14:03.110
Not even trying to hide it, huh?

00:14:05.370 --> 00:14:06.910
Nice to meet you.

00:14:08.330 --> 00:14:16.710
I am Kinou Shia. Starting today,
I have been assigned as your superior.

00:14:17.920 --> 00:14:21.550
Lady Shia?!
The "Second Coming of the Hero,"

00:14:21.550 --> 00:14:23.930
who found the Philosopher's Stone
in the Dungeons of Faria...?!

00:14:23.930 --> 00:14:27.510
Oh, please, don't flatter me.

00:14:27.510 --> 00:14:29.350
I'm no hero!

00:14:38.360 --> 00:14:40.530
Sorry about that.

00:14:40.530 --> 00:14:42.990
I am truly sorry about Mr. Wanibe,

00:14:42.990 --> 00:14:47.200
but I'll go ahead and show you
the new facilities, Mr. Ninomiya.

00:14:47.200 --> 00:14:48.830
Yeah, thanks.

00:14:48.830 --> 00:14:51.540
Exploration Division Groups 1
through 6 are based here,

00:14:51.540 --> 00:14:55.250
in the Exploration Group Headquarters.

00:14:55.250 --> 00:14:58.880
Work schedule and pay calculation
depends on the kind of work.

00:14:58.880 --> 00:15:02.420
For example, the mining group
receives a base salary + bonuses

00:15:02.420 --> 00:15:03.840
with set work hours.

00:15:03.840 --> 00:15:07.930
Exploration Group 7 and 8
have fixed salaries and work hours.

00:15:07.930 --> 00:15:13.180
However, Group 3 is 100% results-based
pay with flexible work hours.

00:15:13.180 --> 00:15:19.110
As you know, the dungeon gives better
rewards the deeper down you go.

00:15:19.110 --> 00:15:23.900
This is the Company Mart, the shop
exclusive to the Exploration Division!

00:15:23.900 --> 00:15:28.410
All of the equipment here is high quality
goods that can't be found elsewhere!

00:15:28.410 --> 00:15:33.080
With the right gear, exploration is easy!

00:15:33.080 --> 00:15:38.460
Oh, preparing such a wonderful store
for us, so that we can go deeper down...

00:15:38.460 --> 00:15:42.130
It's proof that Raiza'ha Mining
is truly a great company.

00:15:42.130 --> 00:15:44.590
Don't you agree?

00:15:44.590 --> 00:15:45.840
I don't agree.

00:15:45.840 --> 00:15:47.010
Huh?

00:15:47.010 --> 00:15:53.390
Look at this. It's all made of
the demonite that we dug up.

00:15:53.390 --> 00:15:56.440
It just means, if you can't meet
the quota set by the company

00:15:56.440 --> 00:15:58.520
or just can't perform well,

00:15:58.520 --> 00:16:02.360
you have to buy stuff here to at least
do some good for the company.

00:16:02.360 --> 00:16:05.650
Forcing workers to buy company
items using their own pay...

00:16:05.650 --> 00:16:09.200
Ugh, this company
really is rotten to the core.

00:16:09.200 --> 00:16:12.450
Why would you say such a thing?!

00:16:12.450 --> 00:16:15.250
Don't you feel honored
to be allowed to work here?!

00:16:15.250 --> 00:16:17.830
Why would you be so negative,
so sarcastic?!

00:16:17.830 --> 00:16:18.790
Huh?

00:16:18.790 --> 00:16:22.460
Work is a wonderful thing!

00:16:22.460 --> 00:16:27.590
Overcoming hardships
to acquire smiles for society...

00:16:27.590 --> 00:16:30.090
What other life can
come even close in value?!

00:16:30.090 --> 00:16:32.720
Spoken like a true corporate grunt...

00:16:32.720 --> 00:16:35.140
I'm not a superhuman like you.

00:16:35.140 --> 00:16:38.190
I don't want the company
to exploit me until I die.

00:16:38.190 --> 00:16:40.100
Oh, is that what you were worried about?

00:16:41.440 --> 00:16:45.690
Risking your life is
easy once you get used to it.

00:16:48.240 --> 00:16:50.070
What? Hey!

00:16:50.070 --> 00:16:51.700
Come on, let's go.

00:16:51.700 --> 00:16:54.280
Hey! Wait! Let go!

00:16:56.830 --> 00:16:58.620
What is this place...?

00:16:58.620 --> 00:17:02.210
What do you mean, what?
This is the third floor of the dungeon.

00:17:02.210 --> 00:17:05.300
It's nothing like what I'm used to seeing.

00:17:05.300 --> 00:17:09.090
The structure begins to change
quite drastically from the third floor.

00:17:09.090 --> 00:17:11.840
But, um, I thought
you've been here before?

00:17:11.840 --> 00:17:16.180
Well... Yes, but it
was through a shortcut...

00:17:17.930 --> 00:17:20.730
Oh, good, a monster,
just when I needed one.

00:17:20.730 --> 00:17:24.060
It's a Hecatoncheire. Out of all
the monsters on the third floor,

00:17:24.060 --> 00:17:27.530
that one ranks right around
the middle in terms of monster rank.

00:17:27.530 --> 00:17:30.030
Oh, look, an accessory between its fangs.

00:17:30.030 --> 00:17:32.280
Perhaps it ate someone recently?

00:17:33.490 --> 00:17:36.950
All right, Mr. Ninomiya, please, fight it.

00:17:36.950 --> 00:17:38.950
Huh? That's impossible!

00:17:38.950 --> 00:17:45.250
You have to, otherwise, how else
would I figure out how strong you are?

00:17:52.010 --> 00:17:57.510
Oh? I didn't want you
to come to me, but...

00:17:59.980 --> 00:18:03.850
Wow, this is a lively one, isn't it?

00:18:03.850 --> 00:18:06.730
Do you seek to stand before me,
as an obstacle?

00:18:09.150 --> 00:18:11.610
Oh, hey! Dungeon Ant A!

00:18:14.240 --> 00:18:16.370
Divine Execution...

00:18:18.910 --> 00:18:21.040
Super Hero Slice!

00:18:28.420 --> 00:18:30.420
That woman...

00:18:30.420 --> 00:18:35.430
Hmm, this was a bit too small
to be a challenge for me.

00:18:35.430 --> 00:18:39.260
She's more trouble than I anticipated...

00:18:39.260 --> 00:18:43.310
Oh, Mr. Ninomiya. Why are you up there?

00:18:43.310 --> 00:18:46.940
I need you to fight a little, otherwise
there's no point in us coming here...

00:18:46.940 --> 00:18:50.940
Oh, that's a dungeon ant.

00:18:51.940 --> 00:18:54.990
What's wrong? Why won't you kill it?

00:18:54.990 --> 00:18:59.830
Well, this one lost the will to fight,
out of fear of me.

00:18:59.830 --> 00:19:02.290
It feels bad to kill it.

00:19:02.290 --> 00:19:05.790
Kill? No.

00:19:05.790 --> 00:19:07.380
You mean exterminate.

00:19:07.380 --> 00:19:10.840
If it has no will to fight,
that just makes the job easier.

00:19:13.340 --> 00:19:15.090
Is it attached to you?

00:19:15.090 --> 00:19:16.840
No, um...

00:19:16.840 --> 00:19:22.980
Come to think of it, you said some
pretty terrible things about the company.

00:19:22.980 --> 00:19:26.810
Wait a minute... You're really a monster!

00:19:26.810 --> 00:19:27.940
Huh?!

00:19:27.940 --> 00:19:29.110
Say your prayers!

00:19:29.110 --> 00:19:30.110
Wait!

00:19:30.110 --> 00:19:31.900
How thoughtless can a person be?!

00:19:31.900 --> 00:19:33.110
Dammit!

00:19:34.900 --> 00:19:37.660
Rim! Dinner time!

00:19:40.910 --> 00:19:45.500
Wh-What is this girl...? What kind
of magic power pressure is this...?

00:19:46.920 --> 00:19:51.040
You've, uh, grown quite a bit
since the last time I saw you.

00:19:51.040 --> 00:19:53.840
You deceiving monster!

00:19:55.840 --> 00:19:56.970
Ouch...

00:19:56.970 --> 00:19:59.470
Now I'll be a bit serious...

00:20:17.910 --> 00:20:20.780
Dude, you pissed Rim off.

00:20:20.780 --> 00:20:23.410
What's up with you?

00:20:23.410 --> 00:20:25.830
Untie me now please!

00:20:25.830 --> 00:20:29.000
This is a serious violation
of company policy!

00:20:29.000 --> 00:20:32.630
You've captured the infidel,
the so-called hero!

00:20:32.630 --> 00:20:35.590
I feel like a past humiliation
has been avenged!

00:20:35.590 --> 00:20:37.840
Working with monsters like this...

00:20:37.840 --> 00:20:40.510
This is unforgivable; it's treason.

00:20:40.510 --> 00:20:43.350
Thanks for waiting, Ninomiya... What?!

00:20:43.350 --> 00:20:44.970
What is this situation...?

00:20:44.970 --> 00:20:46.810
Hey, you made it Wanibe.

00:20:46.810 --> 00:20:48.230
I don't want to be a part of this...

00:20:48.230 --> 00:20:50.650
Are you working with Ninomiya as well?!

00:20:50.650 --> 00:20:55.400
What?! Ninomiya...
What did you do this time?

00:20:55.400 --> 00:21:00.570
To tell you the truth... She found out
that we're working with the monsters.

00:21:00.570 --> 00:21:03.780
What?! Miss Shia, of all people?!

00:21:03.780 --> 00:21:06.250
That's beyond bad!

00:21:06.250 --> 00:21:09.210
I will definitely report
this to the company.

00:21:09.210 --> 00:21:12.420
Also, I, personally,
will never forgive you!

00:21:12.420 --> 00:21:14.840
W-What do we do, Ninomiya?

00:21:14.840 --> 00:21:18.670
If the company finds out,
something terrible will happen to us!

00:21:18.670 --> 00:21:22.180
Don't worry. I have a plan.

00:21:22.180 --> 00:21:23.220
Huh?

00:21:23.220 --> 00:21:25.560
You brought the thing, right?

00:21:25.560 --> 00:21:28.310
Huh? Um... Mr. Ninomiya...?

00:21:28.390 --> 00:21:30.850
Welcome to Dungeon Black Company
Feeling right at home!

00:21:32.730 --> 00:21:34.820
Look how great this turned out!

00:21:34.820 --> 00:21:39.240
Stay quiet about today unless
you want everyone to see this!

00:21:39.240 --> 00:21:41.820
Your fame as a hero
would plummet for sure!

00:21:41.820 --> 00:21:43.530
What... How terrible...!

00:21:43.530 --> 00:21:48.950
Ninomiya... This is what you
made me bring the camera for...

00:21:48.950 --> 00:21:53.250
You are evil!
I vow to one day vanquish you!

00:21:53.250 --> 00:21:57.000
Whatever you say, now you're one of us!

00:21:57.000 --> 00:22:02.130
From now on, you'll work extra hard
for us, the Dungeon Black Company!

00:22:02.130 --> 00:22:08.720
Dungeon Black Company...?
What is that?! That sounds terrible!
